title: "BITE: Evidence Provenance and Controlled Tool-Utility Evaluation for Visual Agents"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research infrastructure for passive visual-agent evidence tracing, controlled
  tool-evidence collection, label-isolated evaluation, calibration, utility,
  uncertainty, and task-level headroom analysis.
keywords:
  - visual agents
  - tool use
  - evidence provenance
  - calibration
  - value of information
  - multimodal reasoning
authors:
  - name: "BITE contributors"
